# What stays on this Mac and never goes to GitHub.
#
# Git keeps every version of every committed file permanently, so anything
# listed here must be listed BEFORE the first commit. Removing a large file
# afterwards means rewriting history, which is far more trouble.

# Working backups. Each editing session leaves a dated copy of build.py,
# styles.css, site.js or CLAUDE.md -- 46 files and 111 MB as of 2026-10-18.
# Only the current version of each is committed.
# Matches a literal ".bak" anywhere in the name, which covers both the
# build.py.bak_desc8 and build.py.bak2025agendas spellings.
*.bak*

# Full-resolution originals. Kept so the WebP files in assets/ can be
# regenerated at a different size later. Too large to publish, and the site
# never loads them. image-originals/ normally sits outside this folder; it is
# listed in case the repository is ever rooted a level higher.
*-original.png
image-originals/

# Agenda PDFs cached by tools/agenda-tables.py. Downloaded from CivicClerk
# on demand and re-fetched if missing, so there is nothing here to keep
# -- 37 MB after one board-year.
tools/.agenda-pdfs/

# macOS folder metadata, created automatically by Finder.
.DS_Store
